+### DeepSeek-V4-Flash native HIP (Strix Halo)
+
+&emsp;&emsp;For **Ryzen AI MAX+ 395 / 128 GB unified memory**. Build lucebox `dflash_server` on host ROCm, load the ROCmFPX MIX-STRIX checkpoint, and enable sparse prefill. Measured decode is a flat **~25 tok/s** from 8K–256K; 3K-prompt sparse prefill is about **230 tok/s**. Mutually exclusive with Qwen3.8-Flash-CIRU.
+
+- **Audience**: Developers who already have a Strix Halo box and want a local DeepSeek-V4-Flash
+- **Difficulty**: ⭐⭐⭐
+- **Time**: compile + ~100 GiB download + reading the measurements
+
+📖 [Open the DS4 native HIP guide](/en/01-deploy/ds4/dflash-native-hip-rocm7-deploy.md)
+
+---
+
+### Qwen3.8-Flash-CIRU (Strix Halo)
+
+&emsp;&emsp;Same **gfx1151 + 128 GB** target. Build CIRU v1.1 `llama-server` with the PLE sidecar (stock llama.cpp cannot load it). Local prefill **matches or beats** the published 512–8K ladder; code / JSON decode at MTP depth 4 is about **46–52 tok/s**. Full pack ~127 GiB; do not co-reside with DS4.
+
+- **Audience**: Developers who already have a Strix Halo box and want a local Qwen3.8-Flash
+- **Difficulty**: ⭐⭐⭐
+- **Time**: compile + ~127 GiB download + reading the measurements
+
+📖 [Open the Qwen3.8-Flash-CIRU guide](/en/01-deploy/qwen3.8/ciru-llamacpp-rocm7-deploy.md)
+
+---
+
